<title>CHILE: Chile Central Bank president hurt in car accident.</title>
<headline>Chile Central Bank president hurt in car accident.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean Central Bank president Carlos Massad was injured in a traffic accident in Santiago Monday afternoon, said a Bank source.</p>
<p>The source said Massad, who was appointed Bank governor last year, was taken to a local hospital for medical tests for minor injuries including a possible broken arm.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
